Subject: [PATCH] Player: optional cinema mode (ambient glow around the
 picture)

Like YouTube's ambient mode: a tiny, blurred copy of the current frame is
stretched behind the video and cross-faded about once a second, so the
letterbox bars glow with the colors of the scene. Off by default.
